|               | (2) simplification         |  6,784       | simplification of applied user array partition & struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas |
|               | (3) aggregate/disaggregate |  5,827       | user struct aggregate/disaggregate pragmas are applied                                 |
|               | (4) array reshape          |  8,738       | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns        |  8,977       | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                            |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                            |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification    |  8,596       | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization        |  8,297       | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
